<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>About Us | VOXARIA</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Learn about VOXARIA Media — Nigeria's trusted source for breaking news, politics, sports, entertainment and international stories.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
  <style>
    .page-layout { max-width: 860px; margin: 50px auto; padding: 0 20px; }
    .page-card { background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 40px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin-bottom: 30px; }
    .page-card h1 { font-size: 2rem; color: #111; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .page-card h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; color: #007bff; margin: 30px 0 10px; }
    .page-card p { font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #444; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .page-card ul { padding-left: 20px; }
    .page-card ul li { font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #444; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .hero-banner {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f2027, #2c5364);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 60px 40px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .hero-banner img { width: 120px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-radius: 10px; }
    .hero-banner h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; margin: 0 0 10px; color: #ffd700; }
    .hero-banner p { font-size: 1.1rem; opacity: 0.9; margin: 0; }
    .team-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 20px; }
    .team-card { background: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
    .team-card h3 { margin: 0 0 5px; font-size: 1rem; }
    .team-card p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #666; }
    .values-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-top: 16px; }
    .value-box { background: #f0f7ff; border-left: 4px solid #007bff; padding: 16px; border-radius: 6px; }
    .value-box h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 1rem; color: #007bff; }
    .value-box p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #444; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/header', { currentPage: 'About' }) %>

<div class="page-layout">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <div class="hero-banner">
    <img src="/voxaria-logo.png" alt="VOXARIA Logo" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/voxaria-logo.png'">
    <h1>About VOXARIA</h1>
    <p>Nigeria's Voice to the World — Accurate, Fast, Trusted.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Who We Are -->
  <div class="page-card">
    <h1>Who We Are</h1>
    <p>
      VOXARIA Media is a digital news platform headquartered in Anambra State, Nigeria.
      We are dedicated to delivering accurate, timely, and impactful news coverage across
      Nigeria and the world. Our name — VOXARIA — is derived from the Latin word
      <em>vox</em>, meaning "voice," reflecting our mission to amplify the stories that matter.
    </p>
    <p>
      Founded with the belief that every Nigerian deserves access to credible and comprehensive
      news, VOXARIA covers everything from local politics and breaking security updates to
      international affairs, sports, entertainment, business, and science.
    </p>
    <p>
      We operate a round-the-clock newsroom that combines human editorial judgment with
      modern technology to ensure our readers are always informed. Whether you are in Lagos,
      Abuja, London, or New York, VOXARIA is your trusted connection to Nigeria and the world.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Our Mission -->
  <div class="page-card">
    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>
      Our mission is simple: to inform, educate, and engage. We believe that a well-informed
      public is the foundation of a stronger society. Every story we publish is guided by the
      principles of accuracy, fairness, and public interest.
    </p>

    <h2>Our Vision</h2>
    <p>
      To become Africa's most trusted and widely read digital news platform — a media
      institution that holds power to account, champions the voiceless, and connects
      Nigerians across the globe.
    </p>

    <!-- Core Values -->
    <h2>Our Core Values</h2>
    <div class="values-grid">
      <div class="value-box">
        <h3>✅ Accuracy</h3>
        <p>We verify every story before publication. Facts come first.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-box">
        <h3>⚡ Speed</h3>
        <p>Breaking news the moment it happens, not hours later.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-box">
        <h3>⚖️ Balance</h3>
        <p>Fair, impartial reporting that represents all sides.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-box">
        <h3>🌍 Impact</h3>
        <p>Stories that matter to real people in real communities.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- What We Cover -->
  <div class="page-card">
    <h2>What We Cover</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Politics & Government</strong> — Federal, state, and local government news across Nigeria</li>
      <li><strong>Security & Crime</strong> — Updates on insecurity, military operations, and public safety</li>
      <li><strong>Sports</strong> — Super Eagles, Premier League, NBA, FIFA World Cup, and more</li>
      <li><strong>Entertainment</strong> — Nollywood, Afrobeats, celebrity news, and lifestyle</li>
      <li><strong>International</strong> — World affairs that affect Nigerians at home and in the diaspora</li>
      <li><strong>Business & Economy</strong> — Naira, oil prices, financial markets, and entrepreneurship</li>
      <li><strong>Science & Health</strong> — Medical breakthroughs, technology, and research</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Contact Info -->
  <div class="page-card">
    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>We welcome tips, corrections, partnerships, and feedback from our readers.</p>
    <p><strong>📍 Address:</strong> Anambra State, Nigeria</p>
    <p><strong>📧 Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@voxaria.org">info@voxaria.org</a></p>
    <p><strong>📱 WhatsApp:</strong> <a href="https://wa.me/2349012567912">+234 901 256 7912</a></p>
    <p><strong>🌐 Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.voxaria.org">www.voxaria.org</a></p>
    <p><strong>📘 Facebook:</strong> <a href="https://web.facebook.com/voxaria" target="_blank">facebook.com/voxaria</a></p>
  </div>

</div>

<footer class="bottom-links">
  <p>© 2026 VOXARIA Blog. All Rights Reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
